Description: group chat with push-to-talk voice over the Katzenpost mixnet
 hushphone is a group chat client for the Katzenpost mix network, with
 push-to-talk voice messages. Its groups are shared with katzenqt, jam and
 frank_chat.
 .
 It does no networking of its own: it talks to a running Katzenpost client
 daemon, kpclientd, over its socket. An AppArmor profile, and a seccomp filter
 the program puts on itself, leave it no IP sockets and no way to start other
 programs.
